# To launch the new frontend (Web UI)
Run the following to launch the Web UI to launch the app in localhost:9001

```bash
uvicorn app:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 9001
```

# Dev settings in .env file
To quicker populate the new dataset form in the Web UI, you can set the following environment variables in the `.env` file:

```bash
# Dev settings, for prefilling the new dataset form for faster testing
PID = 'doi:10.80240/FK2/FCZB4A'
TICKET_NUMBER = 'CUR-999'
FORCE_DELETE = true
CHECK_ZIP = true
CHECK_LIST =  'high'
COLLECTION_ALIAS = 'toronto'
```

You can then load `http://localhost:9005` in your web browser to access the Web UI for curating new datasets.

These will prefill the respective fields in the new dataset form when you launch the Web UI.